<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="RUT" style="id">- Pogoro Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Luti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Shitabu sha Luti</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luti</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lut</para>
  <para style="mt2">Shitabu sha</para>
  <para style="mt1">LUTI</para>
  <para style="mt">ULONGULERU</para>
  <para style="ip">Shitabu sha Luti shiyowelera mauzauza ga malawiru yagaweriti shaka shipindi sha kaya za wana wa Israeli. Shipindi sha watoza wa Israeli. Mawu gwa kaya ayi Naomi, imlangalira kwa shiyasi shikulu sha mpalu gwakuyi na wana wakuyi wapalu wahowiti shaka pawaweriti isi ya shihenga aku Mowabu, kumbiti Naomi kankiti tekelera kwa nahonga gwakuyi, Luti, mweni kalawiriti muisi ya Mowabu wagenditi mwanja kuwuya Israeli na kalongiti hakamtangi. Woseri Luti na Naomi wankiti tekelera shaka kaya ya Bowazi ililolera weri na kujimira kumyuga Luti. Shipindi shilii sha watoza shiweriti shidoda na Waisraeli wavuwa wakaliti pota Lagiru, kumbiti Naomi, Luti na Bowazi waweriti mfanu guherepa kwa wana Waisraeli yawaweriti wagafata malagaliru ga Mlungu. Kwa hera yakavimana mlemba gwa Luti. Shaka sha shitabu pashilembitwi viraa shimanika ndiri, kumbiti su wamonga walihola handa shilembitwi pa Waisraeli kulawira toziya ya luga ya Shibraniya yawatendiritwi. Ayi alama ya Luti mweni waweriti ndiri Muisraeli, Dawudi viraa ina mana kiziti kuwera ntumintumi gwa Yesu ilangulira handa mafira ga Mlungu galola ndiri kaya yagulawira kumbiti galola kumoyu.</para>
  <para style="iot">YAGAWERAAMU</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha kwanja shiyowelera kaya ya Naomi na ntambu yawalikomangiti na wankondu na viraa Naomi na Luti ntambu yawawuyiti Israeli.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha pili hatubetuli kuwera ntambu gaa Luti pakaliwoniti na Bowazi na ntambu yakasoliti mabenangu gakuyi.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha tatu shiyowelera ntambu gaa Naomi pakamlagaliti Luti kumkosiya Bowazi ntambu ya kumyuga na kumlolera toziya yomberi mpalu na mdala waweri pamuhera mundowa. Bowazi kamjimira kutenda Hangu.</para>
  <para style="io">Shipandi sha msheshi shiyowelera ntambu gaa Bowazi kahemeriti nguwu ya mpalu gwa Naomi yakahowiti na kumyuga Luti.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="RUT 1" />
  <para style="s">Elimeleki pamuhera na kaya yakuwi wankugenda Mowabu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 1:1" />Pamakashu, wakolamlima walii yawashemitwi watoza pawaweriti wankukolamlima, shaka tunga kuweriti na njala nkulu muisi ya Israeli. Su muntu yumu yakashemitwi Elimeleki kulawa Betilehemu mulushi lwa Yuda yakaweriti na mdala gwakuwi yakashemitwi Naomi, litawu Naomi liwera na mana kaherepa, pamuhera na wana wau wawili wapalu yawashemitwi Mahaloni na Kilioni, wagenditi kulikala kwa katepu gambira wahenga muisi ya Mowabu. <verse eid="RUT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 1:2" />Womberi waweriti wantu wa shiyuwuku sha Efurati gwa aku Betilehemu muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 1:3" />Su Elimeleki mpalu gwakuwi Naomi, kahowiti na Naomi kasigaliti na wana wapalu wakuwi wawili. <verse eid="RUT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 1:4" />Wantemba walii wayugiti wadala kulawa mlushi lwa Mowabu, Kilioni kamuyugiti mdala yawamshemiti Oripa na Mahaloni kamuyugiti mdala yawamshemiti Luti. Pamivinja lilongu, <verse eid="RUT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 1:5" />Mahaloni na Kilioni viraa wahowiti, su Naomi kasigaliti gweka yakuwi pota kuwera na mpalu ama wana.<verse eid="RUT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Naomi na Luti wankuwuya Betilehemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 1:6" />Shakapanu Naomi pakapatiti visoweru kuwera Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekeleriti wantu wakuwi su wapati mabenu gavuwa, su yomberi pamuhera na wamikawana wakuwi walitandiriti kuwuya Betilehemu. <verse eid="RUT 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 1:7" />Yomberi pamuhera na wamikawana wakuwi wawukiti pahala palii kwawalikaliti, wanjiti mwanja gwa kuwuya muisi ya Yuda. <verse eid="RUT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 1:8" />Kumbiti Naomi kawagambiriti wamikawana wakuwi wawili, “Muwuyi kila yumu ukaya kwa mawu gwakuwi. Nduwa Mtuwa Mlungu kaweri muheri kwa mwenga, ntambu yamuweriti kwaneni na ntambu yamuwatendiriti wapalu wenu pamberi pa kuhowa kwawu. <verse eid="RUT 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 1:9" />Mtuwa Mlungu kawapanani, kila yumu gwenu kapati mpalu gwingi na numba yakuwi.” Shakapanu Naomi kawakisikira na kuwanona, kawagambiriti kwahere. Womberi wanjiti kulila kwa liziwu <verse eid="RUT 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 1:10" />na wamgambiriti, “Ndala! Twenga hatugendi pamuhera na gwenga kuwuya kwa wantu waku.”<verse eid="RUT 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 1:11" />Kumbiti Naomi kawagambira, “Wahinga wangu muwuyi ukaya. Iwera hashi mfira kunfata neni? Mwenga mulihola kuwera, neni haweri na wana wapalu wingi wa kuwayuga mwenga? <verse eid="RUT 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 1:12" />Wahinga wangu muwuyi ukaya kwa walera wenu, neni namgogolu su hapeni nyuguwi kayi na mpalu yumonga. Ata handa panulihola kuwera mempati mpalu pashiru panu na kupata wana, <verse eid="RUT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 1:13" />hashi, mwenga memuwezi kuhepera mpaka wakuli? Hashi, memuwezi kulilewelera kuyuguwa na wapalu wamonga kwajili yawu? Ndala, wahinga wangu! Vitwatira vyaneni vikamala nentu kwajili ya mwenga, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu kantenda ntabiki!” <verse eid="RUT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 1:14" />Shakapanu Luti pamuhera na Oripa waliliti kayi toziya ya shilii shakatakuliti Naomi. Su Oripa kamkisikira na kumnona mikamawu gwakuwi na kuwuya ukaya kwakuwi, kumbiti Luti kasigaliti na mikamawu gwakuwi. <verse eid="RUT 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 1:15" />Su Naomi kamgambiriti Luti, “Guloli muyagu kawuya ukaya kwakuwi na kwa milungu yakuwi. Na gwenga viraa guwuyi, gumfati muyagu Oripa.”<verse eid="RUT 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 1:16" />Kumbiti Luti kamwankuliti, “Nagunduwa nikuleki gwenga, poseri pagugenda, neni hang'endi na gwenga, poseri pagulikala, neni hanulikali pamuhera nagwenga. Wantu waku hawaweri wantu wangu na Mlungu gwaku hakaweri Mlungu gwaku. <verse eid="RUT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 1:17" />Pahala paguhowa, neni hanhowi pahala palii. Na pahala pagusiluwa na neni hansiluwi pahala palii. Mtuwa Mlungu kantendi shoseri handa pandekana na gwenga. Handekani na gwenga hera palii yumu gwetu pakahowa.”<verse eid="RUT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 1:18" />Naomi pakayambuliti kuwera Luti kamlemetera kugenda pamuhera nayu, su kalekiti kumsindikira kawuyi ukaya. <verse eid="RUT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 1:19" />Su wawili awa wendereyiti na mwanja mpaka pawayingiriti Betilehemu. Womberi pawasokiti aku, wantu woseri mlushi walikangashiti kuwawona. Wadala wa lushi lulii walikosiyiti weni, “Hashi, nakamu ayu Naomi?”<verse eid="RUT 1:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 1:20" />Naomi kawagambira womberi, “Namunshema kayi Naomi, kumbiti munshemi Mara, litawu Mara liwera na mana ukaripa, toziya Mtuwa Mlungu yakawera na makakala, kagatenda makaliru gangu gaweri na ukaripa. <verse eid="RUT 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 1:21" />Pambukiti panu, neni weriti na vyoseri, kumbiti vinu Mtuwa Mlungu kambuziya mawoku hera, toziya nahera kaya. Iwera hashi munshema Naomi? Mtuwa Mlungu katenda vintu vidoda vimpati neni, viraa kalekeziya ntabiku nkulu indawili neni.”<verse eid="RUT 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 1:22" />Su Naomi kawuyiti ukaya kwakuwi pakawera na Luti mikamwana gwakuwi kulawa Mowabu. Womberi pawaweriti wankuwuya Betilehemu, shaka sha kubenanga shayili shiweriti shyankwanja.<verse eid="RUT 1:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="RUT 2" />
  <para style="s">Luti kankutenda lihengu mulirambu lya Bowazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 2:1" />Su kuweriti na muntu yumu Kubetilehemu, yomberi kaweriti gwa lukolu lwa Elimeleki mpalu gwa Naomi, yawamshemiti Bowazi. Muntu ayu kaweriti mlunda na kamanikana nentu. <verse eid="RUT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 2:2" />Lishaka limu, Luti kamgambiriti Naomi, “Gundekeziyi ng'endi mumalambu nakasoli viboga vyavilekituwi na wantu yawabenangiti.” Naomi kamwankuliti yomberi, “Su aya gugendi muhinga gwangu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 2:3" />Su Luti kagenditi kumalambu, kanjiti kusola viboga kumbeli kwa yawabenangiti. Yomberi pakaweriti kankusola, kayambuliti kuwera kaweriti kankusola mulilambu lya Bowazi, ulii yakaweriti gwa lukolu lwa Elimeleki mganafu gwakuwi.<verse eid="RUT 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 2:4" />Yomberi pakaweriti kankali kankusola viboga mulilambu, Bowazi kasokiti kulawa Betilehemu, su kawalamsiyiti yawabenanga viboga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kawatekeleri mwenga!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 2:4">Womberi wankuliti, “Mtuwa Mlungu kakutekeleri na gwenga viraa!”<verse eid="RUT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 2:5" />Shakapanu Bowazi kamwoniti Luti, su kamkosiyiti mgolokera gwa yawabenanga viboga, “Muhinga ayu gaa?”<verse eid="RUT 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 2:6" />Mgolokera ulii kamwankuliti, “Muhinga ayu muntu gwa Mowabu, yomberi kiziti kulawa aku pakawera na Naomi. <verse eid="RUT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 2:7" />Yomberi kanduwiti pakalonga, shondi shondi, gundekeziyi neni nsoli vyavisigaliti kumbeli kwa walii yawabenanga viboga. Neni numlekeziya, su yomberi katenditi lihengu lya kusola kwanjira mandawira mpaka vinu. Katepu hera kagenda kwoyera kuliringu.”<verse eid="RUT 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 2:8" />Su Bowazi kamgendiriti Luti na kamgambira, “Gupikanili muhinga gwangu. Nagugenda kusola viboga mulilambu lyamonga, kumbiti gusoli hera mulilambu ali. Gulikolerani pamuhera na wadala awa. <verse eid="RUT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 2:9" />Guloli pahala wapalu wankubenanga, su gwenga guwafati wadala yawabenanga. Neni nuwaberiziya kala wantemba kuwera nawakugaziya kwa kukukolakola. Na paguwera na yumuluwa, gugendi gwatoli mashi gulandi kulawa muvulu zyazimemisiwa na wantemba awa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 2:10" />Bowazi pakalongiti hangu, Luti kamsuntamiriti mpaka pasi kwa ligoya kulonglu kwa muntu ulii, Palii Luti kamkosiya, “Hashi gwenga guwera muheri kwaneni? Mpata ashi upendelewu kulongolu kwaku uganu guvimana neni namuhenga!”<verse eid="RUT 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 2:11" />Bowazi kamwankula, “Wantu wang'ambira vitwatira vyoseri vyagumtendiriti mikamawu gwaku. Womberi wang'ambiriti kuwera gwenga guwaleka walera waku pamuhera na isi yaku, gwiza kulikala pamuhera na wantu yaguwamaniti ndiri kwanja. <verse eid="RUT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 2:12" />Mtuwa Mlungu hakakutenderi maheri gwenga kwa shilii shagutenditi. Mtuwa Mlungu, Mlungu gwa wantu wa Israeli, gwenga yagumtugiriti pasi pa mbapatiru zakuwi, su kakuloleri weri na kakupanani mafupu mavuwa.”<verse eid="RUT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 2:13" />Luti kamwankula, “Mkulu gwangu, neni nendereya kupata upendelewu kulongolu kwaku, gwenga gumpanana neni moyu tembera neni wera ndiri teratera na wantumintumi waku wadala.”<verse eid="RUT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 2:14" />Mushaka sha kuliya shiboga, Bowazi kamshemiriti Luti, “Gwizi, gutoli libumunda na gulitoteli mudivayi guliyi.” Su Luti kalivagiti pasi pamuhera na wantu walii yawabenganiti viboga, Bowazi kampananiti mbunji zyazikalangituwi, yomberi kaziliyiti na kwikuta na kavisigaliti vyamonga. <verse eid="RUT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 2:15" />Luti pakagolokiti kwanja kubenanga kayi, Bowazi kawagambiriti wantumintumi wakuwi, “Mumleki kasoli mikunguwi ya shayili ata ilii yaiwera muilii yamuibenangiti, mwenga namumkalipira. <verse eid="RUT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 2:16" />Viraa mtoli mikunguwi yamonga mumikunguwi yambenangiti, mumleki kayisoli, namumkalipira.”<verse eid="RUT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 2:17" />Su Luti kandereyiti kusola mikunguwi ya shayili mpaka pamihi. Yomberi pakasyogiti mikunguwi ilii na kupeta, kamemiziyiti lijamanda likulu lya kilu lilongu. <verse eid="RUT 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 2:18" />Yomberi kawuyiti kugenda mlushi pakawera na shiboga shilii shakapatiti na kamlanguziyiti mikamawu gwakuwi. Viraa Luti kampananiti kaliyi virii vyavisigaliti pakuliya. <verse eid="RUT 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 2:19" />Su mikamawu gwakuwi kamkosiyiti, “Hashi, viboga avi guvipata koshi? Guvisola mulilambu lya gaa? Mlungu kamtekeleri muntu ayu yakakupananiti upendelewu!” Shakapanu Luti kamgambiriti mikamawu gwakuwi kuusu muntu ulii yomberi pakatenditi lihengu. Luti kamgambiriti, “Muntu ayu yantenditi lihengu nayu kashemwa Bowazi.” <verse eid="RUT 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 2:20" />“Mtuwa Mlungu kamtekeleriti muntu ulii! Naomi kamgambiriti mikamwana gwakuwi, Mlungu kagatenditi weri malagilu gakuyi kwa wantu yawalikala pamuhera na wantu yawahowiti.” Viraa kongeriti kulonga, “Muntu ulii mlongu gwetu gwa pakwegera, womberi wafiruwa kulolera weri.”<verse eid="RUT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 2:21" />Shakapanu Luti muntu gwa Mowabu kalongiti, “Viraa yomberi kang'ambiriti, Gulikali pamuhera na wantumintumi wangu yawabenanga mpaka wamalili kubenanga mpunga gwagu goseri.”<verse eid="RUT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 2:22" />Naomi kamgambiriti Luti mikamwana gwakuwi, “Muhinga gwangu, ntambu ayi hayiherepi kwa gwenga,kuwera pamuhera na wahinga ntumintumi wakuwi, toziya pamonga megugaziwi kukukolakola mulilambu lya muntu gwingi.” <verse eid="RUT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="RUT 2:23" />Su Luti katenditi lihengu pamuhera na wantumintumi wahinga wa Bowazi, kasoliti mabenangu ga mpunga mpaka pagaperiti. Mushaka shilii kendereyiti kulikala na Naomi mikamawu gwakuwi.<verse eid="RUT 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="RUT 3" />
  <para style="s">Luti kankusakula mpalu kayuguwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 3:1" />Lishaka limu Naomi kamgambiriti Luti mikamwana gwakuwi, “Mwana gwangu, neni mona nukusakulili mpalu kakuyugi, su yomberi hakakuloleri weri. <verse eid="RUT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 3:2" />Su Bowazi muntu ulii, gwenga gutenditi lihengu pamuhera na wantumintumi wahinga wakuwi, yomberi kawera mlongu gwa pakwegera nentu. Su gupikanili weri, leru pamihi hakagendi kupeta shayili pahala pa kupetera shayili. <verse eid="RUT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 3:3" />Su gwenga guyogi mashi na gujilembiziyi kwa utuli na guvali nguwu ziherepa. Shakapanu guseleri kugenda yomberi kwakapetera shayili. Gwenga nagutenda yomberi kavimani, kumbiti gumleki mpaka pakamalila kuliya na kulanda. <verse eid="RUT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 3:4" />Pakamalira kuliya, gumloli pahala pakagenda kugonja. Gwenga gugendi na kumgubutula pamagulu gakuyi na gugonji palii. Yomberi pakiimuka hakakugambiri gwenga shintu sha kutenda.”<verse eid="RUT 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 3:5" />Luti kamwankula, “Neni hantendi goseri yagung'ambiliti.” <verse eid="RUT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 3:6" />Su Luti kagenditi pahala pa kupetera shayili, katenda gambira mikamawu gwakuwi ntambu yakamgambiriti.<verse eid="RUT 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 3:7" />Bowazi pakamaliliti kuliya na kulanda, moyu gwakuwi gunemeleriti su kagenditi pakwegera na mikunguwi ya shayili kagonja. Shakapanu Luti kiziti mpolimpoli na kamgubuliti mumagulu ga Bowazi na kugonja palii. <verse eid="RUT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 3:8" />Pashiru nentu, Bowazi kalilimukiti, su kasintukiti na kulikangasha pakamwona mdala kagonja mumagulu gakuyi. <verse eid="RUT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 3:9" />Yomberi kamkosiya, “Gwenga gwa gaa?” Luti kamwankula, “Neni ntumintumi gwaku Luti. Toziya gwenga gwa mlongu gwangu gwa pakwegera, su guligubiki shipandi sha nguwu yaku paneni, kulanguziya kuwera haguniyugi neni.”<verse eid="RUT 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 3:10" />Bowazi kalonga, “Mtuwa Mlungu kakutekeleri muhinga gwangu. Shitwatira ashi shiwera shiheri nentu kuliku shagutenditi pamberi kwa mikamawu gwaku. Gufiriti ndiri wantemba walunda ama wahushu wakuyugi. <verse eid="RUT 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 3:11" />Nagutira! Vinu muhinga gwangu hanikutenderi shilii shaguluwa. Toziya wantu wa lushi alu wavimana gwenga gwa mdala muheri. <verse eid="RUT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 3:12" />Nakaka neni na mlongu gwa pakwegera na nfiruwa kukulolera weri gwenga, kumbiti kwana muntu mlongu gwa pakwegera nentu kuliku neni. <verse eid="RUT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 3:13" />Su gulikali pashiru panu na mandawira haniyoweri na muntu mweni. Handa pakajimira kukuyuga gwenga na kuwalolera weri mwega hayiweri mbaka. Yomberi pakajimira ndiri kukuyuga gwenga, nakaka nilirapa kwa litawu lya Mtuwa Mlungu, hanukuyugi na kuwalolera weri mwenga. Su gugonji panu mpaka mandawira.”<verse eid="RUT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 3:14" />Su Luti kagonjiti mumagulu ga Bowazi mpaka mandawira, kumbiti kimukiti mandawira putiputi wantu nawamwona, toziya Bowazi kalongiti, “Neni nfira ndiri wantu wavimani kuwera mdala kiziti panu pahala pa kupetera shayili.” <verse eid="RUT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 3:15" />Viraa Bowazi kamgambiriti, “Guyaliki nguwu yaku pasi.” Luti katenditi ntambu yawamgambiriti. Bowazi kitira shayili kilu malongu mawili, shakapanu kamtwika. Su Luti kawuyiti mlushi. <verse eid="RUT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 3:16" />Luti kapawuyiti kwa Naomi mikamawu gwakuwi, mikamawu gwakuwi kamkosiya, “Mwana gwangu iweriti ntambu hashi aku?” Shakapanu Luti kamgambiriti kila shintu Bowazi shakamtendiriti <verse eid="RUT 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 3:17" />na kendereyiti kulonga, “Yomberi kampananiti shayili ayi kilu malongu mawili pakalonga, Naguwuya mawoku hera kwa mikamawu gwaku.”<verse eid="RUT 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 3:18" />Shakapanu Naomi kamgambiriti mikamwana gwakuwi, “Mwana gwangu, guhepi mpaka guwoni shashilawira. Bowazi hapeni kanyamali jii mpaka katendi kila shintu shiweri teratera leru.”<verse eid="RUT 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="RUT 4" />
  <para style="s">Bowazi kankumyuga Luti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="RUT 4:1" />Bowazi kagenditi pahala pa kuliwona aku kumlyangu mkulu gwa lushi na kalivagiti palii. Shakapanu mlongu gwapakwegera gwa Elimeleki, ulii Bowazi kamkanditi, kapititi pakwegera na palii. Bowazi kamshemiti, “Ganja gwangu gwizi gulivagi panu. Nfira kuyowera na gwenga.” Su womberi walivagiti pamuhera. <verse eid="RUT 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="RUT 4:2" />Shakapanu Bowazi kawashemiti wakulu lilongu wa lushi, kawagambiriti, “Mulivagi panu,” womberi walivagiti. <verse eid="RUT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="RUT 4:3" />Su Bowazi kamgambiriti ulii mlongu gwakuwi gwapakwegera nentu, “Naomi yakiziti kulawa Mowabu, yomberi kafira kumshuwuziya lilambu lyaliweriti lya Elimeleki mlongu gwetu. <verse eid="RUT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="RUT 4:4" />Su neni mona mbaka nikugambiri visoweru avi. Vinu payiwera gufira lilambu ali, gulihemeli kwa ukapitawu wa yawalivaga panu pamuhera na ukapitawu wa wakulu wa wantu waneni. Kumbiti pagufira ndiri, su gung'abiri nivimani toziya neni namuntu gwa pili pa gwenga.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="RUT 4:4">Su yomberi kawankuliti, “Neni hahemeli.”<verse eid="RUT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="RUT 4:5" />Su Bowazi kalongiti, “Mbaka, pagulihemera lilambu ali kulawa kwa Naomi, gumuyugi Luti mkenja ulii muntu gwa Mowabu. Kwa kutenda hangu, Luti hakaweri na wana wapalu womberi hawahali lilambu lya mpalu gwakuwi yakahowiti.”<verse eid="RUT 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="RUT 4:6" />Muntu ulii kawankuliti, “Hapeni neni hemeli toziya wananguta wangu hapeni wahali lilambu ali. Guhemeli gwenga” <verse eid="RUT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="RUT 4:7" />Mumashaka galii kuweriti na shitiba Muisraeli, muntu yoseri yakahemiliti lilambu liweri lya muntu yumonga, muntu ulii yakashuwuziti lilambu kafiruwa katoli shilwatu shimu sha ulii yakahemeliti. Ntambu ayi ilanguziya kuwera shitwatira ashi shiwera teratera muisi ya Israeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="RUT 4:8" />Su muntu ayu kamgambiriti Bowazi, “Gulihemeli gamweni lilambu.” Shakapanu yomberi kavuliti shilwatu shakuwi na kampananiti Bowazi.<verse eid="RUT 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="RUT 4:9" />Su Bowazi kawagambiriti wakulu walii pamuhera na wantu yawaweriti palii, “Leru mwawoseri mwenga muwera wakapitawu kuwera neni hemela lilambu kulawa kwa Naomi, pamuhera vyoseri vyaiweriti vya Elimeleki na Kiliyoni na Mahaloni. <verse eid="RUT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="RUT 4:10" />Viraa neni numtola Luti, mdala kulawa Mowabu, mkenja gwa Mahaloni kaweri mdala gwangu, su yomberi hakawiyuri wana wapalu hawahali vya ulii yakahowiti. Mwenga mwakapitawu leru.” <verse eid="RUT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="RUT 4:11" />Su wakulu walii pamuhera na walii yawalivagiti kumlyangu mkulu gwa lushi walongiti, “Yina twenga twawakapitawu. Mtuwa Mlungu kamtendi mdala yakiza ukaya kwaku kawiyuri wana wavuwa gambira Raheli na Leya ntambu yawatenditi. Twenga tuvimana kuwera gwenga haguweri mlunda mulukolu lwa Efraimu na hagumaniki nentu panu Mubetirehemu. <verse eid="RUT 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="RUT 4:12" />Kupitira uleri Mtuwa Mlungu yakagenda kukupanana kwa muhinga ayu, kaya yaku hayiweri gambira kaya ya Peresi, ulii Tamari yakamuwuyiri Yuda.”<verse eid="RUT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shiyuwuku sha Bowazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="RUT 4:13" />Su Bowazi kamtoliti Luti kuwera mdala gwakuwi. Shakapanu yomberi kaliwoniti na mdala gwakuwi, Mtuwa Mlungu kamtenditi Luti kaweri na yinda na Luti kawiyuriti mwana mpalu. <verse eid="RUT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="RUT 4:14" />Wadala wa Betilehemu wamgambiriti Naomi, “Kakwisuwi Mtuwa Mlungu, ulii lishaka ali kakuleka ndiri gwenga pota kuwera na mkombora gwa kaya yaku! Yomberi hakaweri muntu yakamanika nentu kupitira Israeli. <verse eid="RUT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="RUT 4:15" />Yomberi hakakutendi kuliholi kuwera gwasyayi kayi na hakakuloleri gwenga pagwiza kuwera mgogolu. Mikamwana gwaku, ulii yakakufira nentu kamwiwula mwana mpalu, mwana ayu hakaweri gwa mana nentu kuliku wana wapalu saba.”<verse eid="RUT 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="RUT 4:16" />Su Naomi kamtoliti mwana ulii kamtula pashifuwa pakuwi na kumlera. <verse eid="RUT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="RUT 4:17" />Wadala yawalikaliti pakwegera palii walongiti, “Naomi kana mwana mpalu.” Womberi wampanana litawu Obedi. Yomberi kaweriti tati gwa Yese, ulii yakaweriti tati gwa Dawudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="RUT 4:18" />Na avi ndo viyuwuka vya Peresi. Peresi kamwiwuliti Hesironi, <verse eid="RUT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="RUT 4:19" />Hesironi kamwiwuliriti Rami, Rami kamwiwuliriti Aminadabu. <verse eid="RUT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="RUT 4:20" />Aminadabu kamwiwuliriti Nahishoni, Nahishoni kamwiwuliriti Salimoni. <verse eid="RUT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="RUT 4:21" />Salimoni kamwiwuliriti Bowazi, Bowazi kamwiwuliriti Obedi. <verse eid="RUT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="RUT 4:22" />Obedi kamwiwuliriti Yese na Yese kamwiwuliriti Dawudi.<verse eid="RUT 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="RUT 4" />
</usx>